OL,3,ATennessee halts executions after
OL,4,AChrista Pike survives two lethal
OL,5,Ainjection attempts
OL,6,
OL,7,FExecutions in Tennessee have been
OL,8,Fhalted for the rest of the year,
OL,9,FGovernor Bill Lee has said, after two
OL,10,Fattempts to execute death row inmate
OL,11,FChrista Pike by lethal injection
OL,12,Ffailed.
OL,14,FSpeaking to reporters on Thursday, Lee
OL,15,Fsaid he was "highly disappointed" about
OL,16,Fthe botched execution, which he called
OL,17,Fone of the state's "most serious
OL,18,Fresponsibilities". He has ordered an
OL,19,Findependent review.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
