OL,3,ATennessee halts executions after
OL,4,AChrista Pike survives two lethal
OL,5,Ainjection attempts
OL,6,
OL,7,FTennessee prison officials on Wednesday
OL,8,Fattempted to administer two lethal
OL,9,Fdoses of pentobarbital to Pike but she
OL,10,Fsurvived and was taken to hospital. Her
OL,11,Fmedical condition is unclear.
OL,13,FPike, 50, was sentenced to death in
OL,14,F1996 for the murder of Colleen Slemmer.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
